WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.450
Book One. Proposition One. of Euclid's Elements Construct an equilateral triangle.

00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:07.450
Given segment A B,

00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:10.810
construct equilateral triangle A B C.

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:13.700
Construct circle A B.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:16.140
Construct circle B A.

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:18.220
Mark intersection C.

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:21.180
Construct segments C A and C B.

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:24.920
Radii A C and A B are equal.

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:28.260
Radii B C and B A are equal.

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:32.320
Therefore A C, A B, and B C are all equal.

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:35.360
Triangle A B C is equilateral.

